This Zoviyo App implementation provides a complete single-page React application with the following features:

Core Features Implemented:
Page Creation and Management

Create new pages with custom names
View all pages in a grid layout
Edit existing pages
Delete pages with confirmation
Component Drag-and-Drop Interface

Drag components from the sidebar
Drop components onto the page canvas
Visual feedback during drag operations
Empty state messaging
Basic Component Library

Text Component: Editable text blocks
Image Component: Image URLs with preview
Button Component: Customizable buttons
Additional Features:
Inline Editing: Click the edit icon to modify component content
Component Management: Delete individual components
Responsive Design: Works on mobile and desktop
Clean UI: Uses Shadcn UI components and Tailwind CSS
State Persistence: All data stored in React state (can be extended to localStorage)
Usage:
Click "New Page" to create a page
Enter a page name and click "Create"
Click "Edit" to open the page builder
Drag components from the left sidebar to the canvas
Click the edit icon on any component to modify its content
Use the trash icon to delete components
Click "Back to Pages" to return to the page list
The app is fully functional and ready to use. You can extend it by adding more component types, implementing localStorage persistence, or adding more styling options.



